        "reason": "Matrix effects were evaluated by testing Milli-Q water, groundwater, and two laundry wastewaters under matched operating conditions (same PFAS spike concentrations, identical adsorbent doses, and 24-h contact time in the same batch configuration). This supports direct comparison of PFAS adsorption performance and allows attribution of differences primarily to matrix composition, especially organic matter in wastewater.",
