          "endpoint_type": "removal",
          "evidence_locator_ids": [
            "S02-E01",
            "S02-E02",
            "S02-E06"
          ],
          "interpretation": "PFAS removal efficiencies were compared across matrices under matched conditions (identical PFAS spikes, adsorbent dose, and contact time). PFAS removal in groundwater remained effective and was similar to or higher than that in Milli-Q water, whereas removal declined in wastewater, especially for PFOA, due to competition from organic matter.",
          "reported_term": "PFAS removal in Milli-Q water, groundwater, and wastewater"
        },
        {
          "endpoint_type": "sorption",
          "evidence_locator_ids": [
            "S02-E02",
            "S02-E06"
