          "interpretation": "Across all tested matrices, AC and BC-W exhibited substantial adsorption capacities of approximately 7.7 mg/g (PFOA), 16.1 mg/g (PFOS), and 4.8 mg/g (GenX), indicating robust PFAS uptake even when matrix constituents such as natural organic matter are present, though with reduced performance in wastewater compared to Milli-Q and groundwater.",
          "reported_term": "adsorption capacities across matrices"
        },
        {
          "endpoint_type": "other",
          "evidence_locator_ids": [
            "S02-E02",
            "S02-E06"
