          "interpretation": "In wastewater matrices, dissolved organic matter competitively occupied adsorption sites, leading to reduced PFAS adsorption, particularly for PFOA, relative to Milli-Q water and groundwater. In contrast, groundwater constituents did not significantly diminish PFAS removal under the tested high-concentration conditions.",
